ier weekend.\r\n\r\nCommunications will be sent to all participants for which a valid email address is provided. Please have this information ready when completing your team registration.\r\n\r\n**Withdrawals and Refunds**\r\n\r\n- Should a team enter a Curling Ontario qualifier and choose to withdraw from an event prior to the entry deadline they will receive a refund, less 10% to cover processing fees.\r\n- To mitigate the disruption caused by last-minute alterations, Teams who choose to change qualifiers forfeit their original entry fee and must pay another full entry fee to register for the new qualifier of their choice.\r\n- Teams cannot change qualifiers after the entry deadline. There are no refunds for teams who withdraw after the entry deadline. \r\n- To change your qualifier you must register for the new one you’d like to participate in BY THE REGISTRATION DEADLINE and email competitions@curlingontario.ca to request to be removed from the one you no longer wish to participate in.\r\n- If a team withdraws after the draw schedule has been released that team’s games will be replaced with byes.\r\n\r\n**New to competition, or looking for a refresher?**\r\n\r\n- Read: Rules Ready, Game On! A Guide to Provincial Qualifying and Championship Play Click to get the guide: https://docs.google.com/document/d/16OMET7c0sfa6i3zzLcPuL6X536Bdolwb99BOv4uu-8E/edit?usp=sharing","team_restriction":"Mens","age_range":"N/A","sponsor":{"url":"https://on.curling.io/en/sponsors/527","logo_url":"https://curlingio.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/sponsor/logo/527/card_runback_brewing.png","name":"Runback Brewing"},"no_registration_message":"Registration closed","teams":[{"id":125996,"name":"Corner","short_name":"Corner","affiliation":"Burlington Golf \u0026 Country Club","lineup":[{"curler_id":76233,"position":"fourth","skip":true,"name":"Peter Corner","waiver":false,"gender":"male"},{"curler_id":182598,"position":"third","name":"Chris Staresinic","club_name":"Burlington Golf \u0026 Country 